   "source": [
    "# \ud83c\udfac YaYa AI - YouTube Shorts Generator\n",
    "\n",
    "Turn any idea into a publish-ready YouTube Short using AI\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features:**\n",
    "- AI Script Generation (Ollama + Qwen2.5)\n",
    "- Stock Video (Pexels/Pixabay)\n",
    "- Text-to-Speech (Edge TTS)\n",
    "- Auto Subtitles (Whisper)\n",
    "- Thumbnail Generation\n",
    "- 1080x1920 HD Video\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step1-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \u2699\ufe0f Step 1: Install Dependencies\n",
    "\n",
    "This installs FFmpeg, Ollama, and Python packages."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "install-deps"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install FFmpeg\n",
    "!apt-get update && apt-get install -y ffmpeg\n",
    "\n",
    "# Install Ollama\n",
    "!curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n\u2705 Dependencies installed!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step2-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83d\udce6 Step 2: Clone Repository"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "clone-repo"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!git clone https://github.com/madhielyousfi/YaYa-ai.git /content/YaYa-ai\n",
    "!cd /content/YaYa-ai && pip install -r api/requirements.txt\n",
    "!cd /content/YaYa-ai && pip install typer pydantic pydantic-settings httpx edge-tts pillow python-dotenv\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n\u2705 Repository cloned and dependencies installed!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step3-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83d\udd11 Step 3: Configure API Keys\n",
    "\n",
    "Get free API keys:\n",
    "- **Pexels**: https://www.pexels.com/api/\n",
    "- **Pixabay**: https://pixabay.com/api/docs/\n",
    "\n",
    "Enter your keys below:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "api-keys"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#@title Enter your API keys here\n",
    "PEXELS_API_KEY = \"\" #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "PIXABAY_API_KEY = \"\" #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Write .env file using Python (avoids shell escaping issues)\n",
    "env_content = f\"\"\"PEXELS_API_KEY={PEXELS_API_KEY}\n",
    "PIXABAY_API_KEY={PIXABAY_API_KEY}\n",
    "OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434\n",
    "OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b\n",
    "TTS_VOICE=en-US-ChristopherNeural\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "with open('/content/YaYa-ai/.env', 'w') as f:\n",
    "    f.write(env_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n\u2705 API keys configured!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step4-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83e\udd16 Step 4: Pull Ollama Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This downloads the Qwen2.5:3b model (~2GB)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "pull-model"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Start Ollama in background\n",
    "!ollama serve &\n",
    "!sleep 5\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pull model\n",
    "!ollama pull qwen2.5:3b\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n\u2705 Ollama model ready!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step5-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83c\udfac Step 5: Generate Video\n",
    "\n",
    "Enter your topic below and run the cell!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "generate"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#@title \ud83c\udfac Enter Your Video Topic\n",
    "topic = \"5 amazing facts about the ocean\" #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "duration = 60 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
    "voice = \"en-US-ChristopherNeural\" #@param [\"en-US-ChristopherNeural\", \"en-US-GuyNeural\", \"en-US-AndrewNeural\", \"en-US-AvaNeural\", \"en-US-EmmaNeural\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.chdir('/content/YaYa-ai')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Update voice in .env using Python\n",
    "env_path = '/content/YaYa-ai/.env'\n",
    "with open(env_path, 'r') as f:\n",
    "    env_content = f.read()\n",
    "\n",
    "import re\n",
    "env_content = re.sub(r'TTS_VOICE=.*', f'TTS_VOICE={voice}', env_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(env_path, 'w') as f:\n",
    "    f.write(env_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Run pipeline\n",
    "!python cli.py run --topic \"$REPLACE_TOPIC\" --duration $REPLACE_DURATION".replace("$REPLACE_TOPIC", topic).replace("$REPLACE_DURATION", str(duration))
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step6-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83d\udce5 Step 6: Download Video\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this cell to download your video."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "download"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import glob\n",
    "\n",
    "# Find latest project\n",
    "projects = sorted(glob.glob('/content/YaYa-ai/output/*/'))\n",
    "if projects:\n",
    "    latest = projects[-1]\n",
    "    mp4_files = glob.glob(os.path.join(latest, '*.mp4'))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if mp4_files:\n",
    "        video_path = mp4_files[0]\n",
    "        print(f'\\n\\u2705 Video ready: {video_path}')\n",
    "        print(f'\\n\\ud83d\\udce5 Download link:')\n",
    "        from google.colab import files\n",
    "        files.download(video_path)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print('\\u274c No video found. Check output folder.')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('\\u274c No projects found. Generate a video first!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "drive-header"
   },
   "source": [
    "## \ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f Optional: Save to Google Drive\n",
    "\n",
    "Mount Google Drive to save videos permanently."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "save-drive"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "import glob\n",
    "\n",
    "projects = sorted(glob.glob('/content/YaYa-ai/output/*/'))\n",
    "if projects:\n",
    "    latest = projects[-1]\n",
    "    dest = '/content/drive/MyDrive/YaYa-ai/'\n",
    "    os.makedirs(dest, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "    shutil.copytree(latest, dest + os.path.basename(latest), dirs_exist_ok=True)\n",
    "    print(f'\\u2705 Saved to Google Drive: {dest}')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('\\u274c No projects to save.')"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
